{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわかつきっ(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼キャプテン桜井顎とツーショット／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/22/6369698/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お台場合衆国でのめざましライブにお越しくださった皆さんありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46一周年という記念すべき日にメンバー33人で皆さんと一緒にライブが出来たなんて、本当に幸せ過ぎて言葉に出来ません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、私の目の前に広がった応援しに来てくださった皆さんの姿にとても幸せで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しくて、沢山の想いが込み上げてきて......胸が熱くなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何の取り柄もなく、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分がわからなくない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将来に迷って立ち止まってしまっていた私を救ってくれたのは..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生まれ変わらせてくれたのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年、乃木坂のＨＰを開かなかったら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時、オーディションを受けていなかったら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの日に皆さんに出逢えていなかったら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は今、こんな風に笑っていれたかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、いつも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当にありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一周年を一緒に過ごせてよかった。会えてよかった(σ*´∀｀)照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして実は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっそり父が１人で見に来てくれていたみたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山迷惑をかけて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山心配をかけてしまっていたから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父に頑張ってる姿を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見せられてよかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、もっと頑張るからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自慢の娘になるからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ!!前回のブログも固い内容でしたので今日の若月ブログのラストは明るくいきませっせ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちの井上小百合。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと、お昼のお弁当を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べるのに10時間かかります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう時すでに夜です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜ですが、お昼のお弁当です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜に食べていますが、夕飯ではなく昼食なんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、肉まんは３時間だよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂でよくある光景↓↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん『もぐもぐ......』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー『さゆにゃん相変わらず、ゆっくりだなぁ〜』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん『もぐもぐ...も...』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事して ２時間後に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"控え室に戻ってくる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん『......もぐもぐ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー『(゜Д゜)...』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん『もぐもぐ(´｀)？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー『まだ食してるだ...と...。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん『味わいたいの。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー『味わいすぎて味がわからなくなりそう(笑)』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、ばかつきぃ♪(/ω＼*)"}],"source":"archive"}